@startuml
title Activity 06 - Admin Freeze Account (governance control style)
start
|OpsConsole|
:Submit freeze request and reason code;
|CoreAPI|
:Validate administrator role and permissions;
if (Authorized?) then (yes)
  :Fetch ACCOUNT state;
else (no)
  :Reject request and log security event;
  stop
endif
|CaseMgr|
:Link freeze action to active case;
if (Account already frozen?) then (yes)
  :Return idempotent success;
  stop
else (no)
  :Continue freeze workflow;
endif
|CoreAPI|
:Apply ACCOUNT status=FROZEN;
|CoreAPI|
:Revoke active AUTH_SESSION tokens;
fork
|CoreAPI|
:Block payments/cards/withdrawals;
fork again
|NotifySvc|
:Send customer and branch notifications;
fork again
|CaseMgr|
:Set review checkpoint and owner;
end fork
if (High-risk customer segment?) then (yes)
  |OpsConsole|
  :Escalate to senior fraud officer;
else (no)
  :Keep normal review cadence;
endif
|AuditSvc|
:Write immutable freeze audit record;
stop
@enduml
